Hi,

wow...

you can use Gaussian approximations only, if you set

	control.inla = list(strategy = "gaussian")

if you have many observations, this might be ok.

also you can run a new age-group, starting from the previous age-group
(assuming some continuity), with

inla(..., control.mode = list(result = prev.result, restart=TRUE))

and those together should really help.

let us know...

H

